Longest Subarray with Sum K

In the previous question where we did subarray with Sum k, here we are going to find the longest subbary with the same sum.
Previously we store the prefix sum with the frequency... but now we are not going to find count rather store the index of the prefix sum which has occured.


Code:
class Solution {
    public int longestSubarray(int[] arr, int k) {
        // code here
        HashMap<Integer,Integer> map = new HashMap<>();
        int maxLen=0;
        int prefix=0;
        map.put(0,-1);
        int len=0;
        for(int i=0;i<arr.length;i++){
            prefix+=arr[i];
            int complement_prefix = prefix-k;
            
            if(map.containsKey(complement_prefix)){
                len = i-map.get(complement_prefix);
                maxLen = Math.max(maxLen,len);
            }
            
            if(!map.containsKey(prefix)){
                map.put(prefix, i);
            }
        }
        
        return maxLen;
    }
}
